The scrolls aren't there to let players smash through Sokoban; they're 
there to allow players to recover from unavoidable bad luck.  For 
example, when you're pushing a boulder down a corridor and a monster 
spawns between it and the pits at the end--your only recourse is to 
destroy the boulder, which leaves you stuck without a way of creating 
more.

